{"id":"0f27f101-41d6-4f5f-6e84-08df2e916917","journalId":"ca96256b-6ca1-407f-866e-567ef9430123","sectionId":"939bf2c2-87b4-4141-b626-08db6b943832","firstLevelSectionId":"257b103f-1eb2-4f24-a170-4e553c7e4aac","secondLevelSectionId":"da638b3b-d38f-4c4b-b5bf-08db6b943832","title":"DELIBERAÇÃO SP-ÁGUAS Nº 32, DE 6 DE NOVEMBRO DE 2026","slug":"executivo/secretaria-de-meio-ambiente-infraestrutura-e-logistica/deliberacao-sp-aguas-n-32-de-6-de-novembro-de-2026-202611061133112032263595","date":"2026-11-09","journal":"Executivo","section":"Agência de Águas do Estado de São Paulo - SP-Águas","firstLevelSectionName":"Atos Normativos","secondLevelSectionName":"Secretaria de Meio Ambiente, Infraestrutura e Logística","publicationType":"Deliberação","editionPages":[],"content":"<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; padding-left: 31.25%; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Revoga as Delibera&ccedil;&otilde;es SP-&Aacute;GUAS n&ordm; 11 e n&ordm; 12, de 23 de setembro de 2025, que declararam escassez h&iacute;drica quantitativa na bacia hidrogr&aacute;fica do Alto Tiet&ecirc; e na por&ccedil;&atilde;o de compet&ecirc;ncia do Estado de S&atilde;o Paulo da bacia hidrogr&aacute;fica do Rio Piracicaba.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; padding-left: 31.25%; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Processo SEI n&ordm; 137.00013664/2025-50</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">O Conselho Diretor da Ag&ecirc;ncia de &Aacute;guas do Estado de S&atilde;o Paulo - SP-&Aacute;GUAS, no uso das atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es conferidas pela Lei Complementar n&ordm; 1.413, de 23 de setembro de 2024, pelo Decreto n&ordm; 69.339, de 4 de fevereiro de 2025, e pelo Regimento Interno da SP-&Aacute;GUAS,</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">DELIBERA:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Artigo 1&ordm; -&nbsp;</strong>Ficam revogadas as Delibera&ccedil;&otilde;es SP-&Aacute;GUAS n&ordm; 11 e n&ordm; 12, de 23 de setembro de 2025.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: justify; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Artigo 2&ordm; - </strong>Esta Delibera&ccedil;&atilde;o entra em vigor na data de sua publica&ccedil;&atilde;o.</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: right; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">S&atilde;o Paulo, na data da assinatura digital.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: center; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">CAMILA ROCHA CUNHA VIANA</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; text-align: center; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-